I hoisted the profile pointer into a local and added branch hints for the common lazy-lookup path, reducing redundant loads and improving code layout.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 0))
        return type;

    const auto* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == nullptr, 0))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    if (profileIndex >= p->numFields)
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return p->fields[profileIndex].type;
}
```